      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Título"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To edit in Final Cut or another editor. Very large files." : {
      "comment" : "The export sheet: when to pick ProRes 422",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para editar en Final Cut u otro editor. Archivos muy grandes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To edit in Final Cut with more quality. The largest files." : {
      "comment" : "The export sheet: when to pick ProRes 422 HQ",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para editar en Final Cut con más calidad. Los archivos más grandes."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To export a part, mark it with I and O." : {
      "comment" : "The export sheet: under Range, while the timeline has no marks",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para exportar una parte, marcarla con I y O."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To record system audio, first turn it on in the recording control to give permission. Recording without it." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para grabar el audio del sistema, primero hay que activarlo en el control de grabación y dar el permiso. Se graba sin él."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To record your voice, on a track of its own." : {
      "comment" : "Under the microphone in the permissions window",
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Para grabar la voz en una pista propia."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "To switch desktops from here, Toma needs the Accessibility permission. ⌃← and ⌃→ work the same from the keyboard." : {
      "localizations" : {
